        "name": "06. Ki, Movement & Sensing",
        "type": "text",
        "sort": 600000,
        "text": {
          "format": 1,
          "content": "<article class=\"dbzf-rulebook\"><h2>Battle Power and Ki</h2>\n<p>At the start of combat, characters have no Ki available and must charge it. Current Battle Power is the maximum Ki capacity that can be gathered and used before recovery. Unused charged Ki decays out of combat.</p>\n<table class=\"dbzf-table\"><tr><th>Rule</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Ki Capacity</td><td>Current Battle Power.</td></tr><tr><td>Power Up %</td><td><code>starting (Character Creation) Physical + Mental</code> as a percentage of Battle Power. Set at creation; later stat gains do not change it, only techniques, traits, or bonuses do.</td></tr><tr><td>Charge Ki Action</td><td>Gather Ki equal to Power Up.</td></tr><tr><td>Quick Charge Reaction</td><td>Gather half Power Up. Can combine with Charge Ki.</td></tr><tr><td>Out-of-combat Ki decay</td><td>Unused charged Ki decays at Power Up per hour.</td></tr><tr><td>Expended Ki recovery</td><td>Recovered at the same rate while resting/not doing something important unless special items or magic accelerate it.</td></tr></table>\n<h2>Flight and Super Speed</h2>\n<p>In combat, Ki can increase Move up to double natural Move. Out of combat, spend Ki to travel at Mach-scale speed for 10 minutes per expenditure. Maximum speed is based on Power Skill Total: a Power Skill Total of 90 allows Mach 9.</p>\n<table class=\"dbzf-table\"><tr><th>Speed</th><th>Distance per 10 Minutes</th><th>Cost</th></tr><tr><td>Mach 1</td><td>128 miles / 206 km per 10 minutes</td><td>20 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 2</td><td>256 miles / 412 km per 10 minutes</td><td>30 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 3</td><td>384 miles / 618 km per 10 minutes</td><td>40 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 4</td><td>512 miles / 824 km per 10 minutes</td><td>50 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 5</td><td>640 miles / 1030 km per 10 minutes</td><td>60 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 6</td><td>767 miles / 1234 km per 10 minutes</td><td>70 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 7</td><td>895 miles / 1440 km per 10 minutes</td><td>80 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 8</td><td>1023 miles / 1646 km per 10 minutes</td><td>90 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Mach 9</td><td>1151 miles / 1852 km per 10 minutes</td><td>100 Ki per 10 minutes</td></tr></table>\n<h2>Ki Sense</h2>\n<p>Ki Sense works like a living Scouter for characters in tune with natural energy. Each tier has a Mind prerequisite/DC and a detection ceiling.</p>\n<table class=\"dbzf-table\"><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Mind DC</th><th>Detection Rules</th></tr><tr><td>Basic Ki Sense</td><td>DC 25 Mind</td><td>Detect BP up to 50,000 as a feeling relative to self; ignorant above 100,000 except “overwhelming”; accurate range 8,000 km; individual BP only to half that range.</td></tr><tr><td>Practiced Ki Sense</td><td>DC 50 Mind</td><td>Detect BP up to 500,000 as a feeling; ignorant above 1,000,000 except “overwhelming”; accurate range 16,000 km; individual BP only to half that range.</td></tr><tr><td>Keen Ki Sense</td><td>DC 100 Mind</td><td>Detect any BP with estimated numerical range; accurate range 40,000 km; can determine individual BP up to that range.</td></tr><tr><td>Holistic Ki Sense</td><td>DC 200 Mind</td><td>Detect any BP and pin numerical values like a Scouter; accurate within a galactic area; individual determination up to a solar system span, otherwise senses large energies outside the system.</td></tr></table><section aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dbzf-keywords\" hidden=\"\">ki battle power power up charge ki flight super speed mach ki sense scouter</section></article>"
        },
